cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Balanced squares, impossible rectangles, and Bertrand's Postulate: supplementary verification code"
abstract: >-
  Verification scripts for the paper "Balanced squares, impossible rectangles,
  and Bertrand's Postulate". They re-derive every finite computation in the
  paper: the sharp form of Bertrand's Postulate (Theorem A), the Ramanujan-prime
  route to its finite check, the balanced arrays and censuses, and the
  computational inputs of the classification of balanced m x n arrays
  (Theorem B).
type: software
